    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ëmërëmo gia Abhanchaama na Abharawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ÖMÖNENE agateebhia Haruni iga, “Uwe na abhaana bhaao na ikiaro kieinyu gionsui hamui na uwe mmöraitungue na öbhöbhëëbhë bhöa ahasë ahahoreeru; uwe na abhaana bhao mbainyu mmöraitungue na öbhösaria bhonsui bhu ubhunchaama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamui na bhainyu mörente bhamura bha mueinyu, bhi ikiaro kia Abharawi, ikiaro ke bhaise weinyu, iga korri bhabhe hamui na bhainyu, na bhabhakorre ëmërëmo gönkaaga ëno uwe na abhaana bhao ndanyoorrë mörëngë guitunteera irihoreeru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuhika bhahiki ëmërëmo keebhörë öbhahaayë na këëra këbhaitungërë gökora guitunteera, sibhoono bhariihe kuhika hang'i ibhintö bhia ahasë ahahoreeru, gösë irikëngë, hano bharakore igo mbaraitue, na uwe wonsui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuhika bhakore ëmërëmo hamui na uwe na kuhikia këra këbhaitungire gökora guitunteera re gusikanëra, na muriihe möntö wöndë öno ataragërë atagaacha köbhahika hang'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhainyu mökore gara gabhaitungërë köhasë ahahoreeru na guikëngë, korri ubhusinanku bhoone bhötagaacha kunyahaara Abhaisiraeri guiki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuni naahöra bhamura bha mueinyu Abharawi gatai ya Abhaisiraeri, bhabhe igituho harë bhainyu. Mbaahöröa gikugira yaane uni ÖMÖNENE, korri bhakore ëmërëmo guitunteera re gusikanëra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono uwe umuene na abhaana bhao mökore ëmërëmo gionsui giu ubhunchaama kugira yi irikëngë na bhionsui bhino bhirëngë köhasë ahahoreeru. Naabhaha ubhunchaama bhöbhe igituho keinyu. Ömöntö wöndë öno ataragëre hano arahike hang'i ibhintö bhi iritume, aitua.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ësöro ya Abhanchaama",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ÖMÖNENE agateebhia Haruni iga, “Ndaköha ibhiruusio bhino Abhaisiraeri bhakunduusiria, ibhintö bhionsui ibhihoreeru bhino bhang'a: Ibhintö bhionsui bhino bhiasaabhuurua na Abhaisiraeri. Ndakubhiha bhionsui bhiyö uwe na uruibhöro rooo köbha iring'ënga reinyu, nabhio mbirabhaitunge kuya ëyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubhintö ibhihoreeru bhökong'u bhino bhitagösambërëërröa kömörro, bhiyö mbiraabhe ibhienyu: Ësataaka yi ibhiakörëa, ikimuenso ki iriraga na ikimuenso ki irisaria. Ëgëntö kërë gionsui abhantö bharaayi bharanduusiria köbha ëgësengero ënhoreeru nkëraabhe ëkeo na abhaana bhao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibhintö bhiyö möraayi mörabhinyeera ahasë ahahoreeru bhökong'u haara na bhirëëbhöe na abhasaacha abhiene, ibhintö bhiyö ni ibhihoreeru harë bhainyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Guiki ibhintö bhindë bhionsui bhino Abhaisiraeri bharanduusiri gë ësataaka ya götentia, mbiraabhe ibhiao. Ndaköha uwe, abhaana bhaao na abhasubhaati bhao bhibhe ibhienyu kuya ëyö. Öre wonsui körösabho rooo öno ataana ibhikui aratöra körëa ibhintö bhiyö.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ndabhaha ibhintö bhionsui ibhiiya kurua köbhötongore bhino nkuruusiribhua na Abhaisiraeri kömeeka gionsui: Amaguta amaiya, itibhaai inchiiya, na ichiheke ichinchiiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakö ga mbere amatobho gonsui kurua kömegöndö geebho gano bharandetere uni, ngaraabhe agaao. Ömöntö örë wonsui wë ëka yaao, öno ataana ibhikui aratöra kögarëa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.27.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abhar 27:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ëgëntö kërë gionsui keehööyöë gönsë ya Isiraeri nkëraabhe ikienyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ibhitangi bhionsui bhi ichitugo na abhantö bhino Abhaisiraeri bharanduusiri uni mbiraabhe ibhiao. Sibhoono kuhika öbhohori abhaana bhonsui abhatangi, na ibhitangi bhionsui bhi ichitinyi chino chiina ibhikui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibhitangi bhiyö bhionsui kuhika bhibhohoribhui bhikërë na umueri gumui nabhio bhihakanëröe ichisekeri isaano cha amatiini gi ichimbiria köreng'aana na ibhirengo bhi iritume irihoreeru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono ibhitangi bhi iching'ombe, ichimburi na amang'ondi bhianga köbhohoribhua, gikugira bhiyö ni ibhihoreeru. Amaanyinga gaabhio ögahömëërra guikëngë rë ësengero na amaguta gaabhio gasambërëërröa gë ësataaka yi ikimuenso kiö ömörro ëno isiisui yaayo ëgötegeria ÖMÖNENE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichinyama chacho ni ichaao, kugituubhanio ömötëma na ëkënama ke bhörëo bhino bhikuruusibhua köbha ësataaka ya götentia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ndaköha uwe, abhaana bhaao na abhaisubhaati bhaao, ibhiruusio ibhihoreeru bhionsui bhino Abhaisiraeri bhakunduusiria guchinsikö chonsui chino chigucha nibhieinyu. Ënö ni imuuma ya kuya ëyö harë uni ÖMÖNENE kugira yaao na uruibhöro rooo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ÖMÖNENE agateebhia Haruni iga, “Uwe töraabhe na ömöndö görë gonsui gönsë yaabho, gösë köbha na ing'ënga rërë rionsui harë bho hai, Uni nu uni ndëngë iring'ënga na ömöndö gooo gatai ya Abhaisiraeri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
